  "title": "Review: festivals & friends",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "Match the greeting to the occasion:\n\n- Eid — **ঈদ মোবারক**\n- Bengali New Year — **শুভ নববর্ষ**\n- after Durga Puja — **শুভ বিজয়া**\n- birthday — **শুভ জন্মদিন**\n- to a whole group — **সবাইকে ঈদের শুভেচ্ছা**\n\nAnd match the register to the person: **চলেন** with your teacher, **চলো** with a classmate, **চল** with your best friend. When in doubt, go one level *more* polite.\n\n**যদি** \"if\" + present tense: **যদি সময় হয়** \"if there's time\" — a soft way to invite.",
